mdl 1;
-- mendixlabs/mxcli#1404: a Java action parameter typed by a type parameter that
-- no `entity <T>` parameter declares (GenAICommons'
-- ChunkCollection_AddKnowledgeBaseChunk, `MxObject: "Entity"`). describe printed
-- the reference with no declaration, and exec wrote it as the entity `.Entity`:
-- mx check CE1613 "The selected entity '.Entity' no longer exists."
-- Expected: the `<"Entity">` header declares it, exec writes MxObject as that
-- type parameter, and `describe java action MyFirstModule.JA_Bug1404` prints the
-- header back. Without the header, check refuses the statement (MDL-JA01).
create or modify java action MyFirstModule.JA_Bug1404<"Entity">(
    HumanReadableID: String not null,
    MxObject: "Entity"
) returns Boolean
as $$
return true;
$$;
